' ==============================================================================
' @file 4-4-crisismap-submit-report-SD.puml
' @brief Conceptual Sequence diagram for disaster report submission and location validation.
'
' @details
' This artifact models the dynamic interaction of a citizen submitting a new 
' disaster report. It captures the frontend client logic for location permissions 
' and the backend API orchestration for validation and persistence.
'
' System Requirements Addressed:
' - Graceful degradation of UI features (handling blocked location APIs).
' - Separation of concerns across API routing, business logic, and storage.
' - Explicit REST API contracts (400, 201, 500) for error and success states.
'
' Author(s): Vlado Sruk
' Context: Software Engineering Course
'
' AI Usage Disclosure:
' Designed by Vlado Sruk. AI-assisted revision and documentation comments were
' reviewed by the author, who is responsible for the final content.
'
' Traceability Note:
' The HTTP statuses, method calls, and conditional branches defined herein must 
' map directly to the finalized frontend component logic and backend controllers. 
'
' Diagram level: Conceptual Interaction Design
' Diagram type:  Sequence Diagram
' ==============================================================================

@startuml

skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

autonumber

' ==============================================================================
' Lifelines (Stereotyped)
' ==============================================================================
actor Citizen as User
participant WebClient as Web <<UI>>
participant BrowserGeoAPI as Geo <<External>>
participant ReportAPI as API <<API>>
participant ReportService as Service <<Application>>
database ReportStore as Store <<Persistence>>

' ==============================================================================
' Phase 1: Location Resolution
' ==============================================================================
User -> Web++ : open report form

alt device location requested
  User -> Web : use current location
  Web -> Geo++ : getCurrentPosition()
  
  alt permission granted
    Geo --> Web : coordinates
    Web --> User : show selected location
  else permission denied
    Geo --> Web-- : permission error
    Web --> User : offer manual selection
    User -> Web : select location on map
  end
  
else manual location chosen
  User -> Web : select location on map
end

' ==============================================================================
' Phase 2: Submission, Validation & Storage
' ==============================================================================
User -> Web : enter details & submit
Web -> API++ : POST /reports (details, coords)
API -> Service++ : validateAndSubmit()

alt input or location invalid
  Service --> API : ValidationException
  API --> Web : 400 Bad Request
  Web --> User : show corrections
  
else report valid
  Service -> Store++ : save(report)
  
  alt save succeeds
    Store --> Service : report ID
    Service --> API : success
    API --> Web : 201 Created
    Web --> User : show confirmation
    
  else storage fails
    Store --> Service-- : DataException
    Service --> API-- : SystemException
    API --> Web-- : 500 Internal Server Error
    Web --> User-- : show failure & retry option
  end
end

@enduml